# Keeps this directory in the repository.
#
# `docs/aegis/plans/` and `docs/aegis/work/` are part of the Aegis workspace
# layout that `aegis-workspace.py check` requires. They hold no committed
# content, and git cannot track an empty directory — so without this file a
# fresh clone is missing them and the workspace check fails there while
# passing in every working copy that happened to create them already.
